      <activity id="887c41a9-43cb-5bc1-a087-8bc45a934d96" activityNameId="1658253c-b1ba-5348-83cc-e3a34cef23d9" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Slag compartment</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Slag compartment
slag compartment for bottom ash from municipal solid waste incinerator. The compartment is a sealed-off part of a sanitary landfill. 375'000 m3 volume. Construction phase is 5 years;
UUID: 085102e3-c9cc-3bad-940a-03c7db21125e
infrastructure materials for landfill construction, operation and aftercare. Including access road.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Slag compartment for MSWI bottom ash as part of a Swiss sanitary landfill. With base seal, leachate collection system. Recultivation and monitoring for 75 years after closure.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: data from one literature source on sanitary landfill, adapted to features of this landfill type 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_085102e3-c9cc-3bad-940a-03c7db21125e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
